    "description": "PulseCare: Health Tracker is a heart rate monitor that designed to help you measure & record your heart rate and pulse. Just put your fingertip on camera to get your heartbeat within a few seconds. No professional equipment required!\r\n\r\n\u2764 <b>Key Features</b>\r\n- heart rate measurement simply within seconds\r\n- scientific graphs and statistics\r\n- heart rate recorder\r\n- health knowledge\r\n\r\n\u2605<b> How to use it?</b>\r\nOur App uses the camera of your phone to capture the image and uses algorithms to recognize the heartbeat. Simply place your finger on your phone's camera. \r\n\r\n\u2605<b> Is it accurate?</b>\r\nPlace your finger on your phone's camera, PulseCare will detect subtle changes in blood concentration, thus getting you heart rate readings. If you need professional heart rate detection, please use professional medical equipment.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca1NOTE</b>\r\n+ PulseCare uses the camera of your phone to capture the image and uses algorithms to recognize the heartbeat, the results may be biased.\r\n+ PulseCare is designed to support the recording of indicators and cannot measure blood pressure or blood sugar levels.\r\n+ The tips provided in the app are for reference purposes only.\r\n+ PulseCare cannot replace professional medical equipment. If you have a medical condition or are worried about your heart condition, please consult a doctor promptly.",
